# This file itself
.distignore

# Knowledge half-life (#744) is a proposal that no skill reads yet. Its two seed
# files are the first shipped paths added since the pinned update foundation, and
# every installed contract before #744 refuses them as unclassified, so a release
# carrying them cannot be installed by any existing vault. Hold them back until
# installed contracts know the paths; core/utils/freshness.py reads a missing
# config as UNAVAILABLE by design.
System/knowledge-half-life.yaml
System/knowledge-half-life.example.yaml
